        "created_at": "2013-04-30T01:33:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sounds like we do the same thing, McBehrer. The set we usually play with has all the hero character cards (including alts) as a deck that we sort through and/or shuffle to pick our hero. Same with the large villain cards.</p><p>Really like what you created, though, Spiff! I'm going to bring it to the next session to see if we use it. Thanks!</p>",
